+
 	/* Whether the tracee itself requested the "no new privileges" flag
 	 * via prctl(PR_SET_NO_NEW_PRIVS).  PRoot always sets the real kernel
 	 * flag in the child before execve (it is a precondition for installing
-- 
2.43.0

